        "created_at": "2015-02-20T01:18:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>DC stands for Detective Comics, and it has Batman, the detective. So, yep, DC has one ;)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Oh boy, the dark watch update for BfbC took me a minute to figure out. There is some formatting issue i was running into that i got around for now, but Pinion+the dark watch is updated to the new, all in one page format. Its too bad we don't have a lot of info on the Dark Watch phase of their promo's! But this new 'all in one page' format is great for the Matriarch. Pinion hyperlinks just go straight to the Matriarch's page, and her Pinion bit is on there. Good timing for my editing update!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>More promo updates moving to their main character's pages will come monday</p>",
